  <!-- 13 FAQ -->
  <section class="faq-section section-padding" id="faqs" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header text-center">
        <span class="badge badge-amber">Common Questions</span>
        <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p>Clear, direct answers regarding rewinding services, testing, and turnaround times.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-container">
        <!-- Question 1 -->
        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What types of motors do you rewind?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>We rewind single-phase and 3-phase AC induction motors, DC motors, armatures, generator alternators, transformer coils, and industrial pump motors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Question 2 -->
        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you handle AC and DC motors?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes, we provide complete rewinding, stator insulation, armature overhaul, commutator undercutting, and brush alignment for both AC and DC equipment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Question 3 -->
        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How long does rewinding take?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Turnaround depends on the motor rating, core condition, copper requirements, and current workshop workload. We prioritize emergency factory breakdowns to minimize plant downtime.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Question 4 -->
        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How is rewinding cost calculated?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Cost is determined by motor horsepower/kW rating, frame size, weight of electrolytic copper wire, insulation grade (Class F or H), and any mechanical work such as bearing replacement. We inspect the motor and provide a clear quotation before beginning work.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Question 5 -->
        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you provide motor testing?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Yes. Every repaired motor undergoes pre-delivery testing including Megger insulation resistance testing, winding resistance balance, and no-load current checks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Question 6 -->
        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Where is the workshop located?</span>
            <div class="faq-icon">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
            </div>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Shop No. 28 &amp; 29, Express House, Near C.N.G. Gujarat Gas Station, N.H. 48, GIDC, Vapi, Gujarat 396195, with direct national highway access for trucks and transport.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

